{
  "name": "Generate From Scene Cast - Source Profile (fbTools)",
  "_setup_notes": "Built from a real, working export: templates/minimax_h3_r2v_source_profile.api.json in the comfyui-fbTools repo (exported from the user's own video_minimax_h3_r2v_comps_upscale.json workflow, 2026-10-02). No Composition is used in this mode -- fbt_SourceProfileClipPrompt (node 3796) replaces fbt_CompositionLoad/fbt_PromptCompositionLoader entirely, assembling the prompt from the chosen Source Profile clip's own stored action/subject analysis, optionally overridden per-subject by SceneCastBuild's cast (hybrid source+bundle entries). Four inputs were swapped for OpenShot placeholders: fbt_SourceProfileLoad's profile_name (node 3906), fbt_SourceProfileClipPrompt's clip_id (node 3796), fbt_SceneCastBuild's cast_entries_json (node 3801), and fbt_SceneCastBuild's background_override_id (node 3801, added 2026-10-02 -- lets a generation override the clip's own stored background without editing the Source Profile itself; empty = use the clip/profile default, \"none\" = no background this run). SceneCastBuild's OWN clip_id field is left empty -- it only feeds the ordinal/pronoun-pool resolution path (match_mode: \"ordinal\" cast entries), which this v1 (one Source Profile + one Clip Segment, explicit source_subject_id per row, no ordinal matching) never uses. composition_overrides_json is fixed at \"{}\" since SceneCastBuild never reads it when a source_profile is connected (see nodes/scene_casts.py -- the override-applying branch is gated on \"not connected_profiles\"); background_override_id is the separate, Source-Profile-mode-only mechanism for this instead. This field is ignored by OpenShot/ComfyUI; it's just a note for future-you.",
  "menu_category": "enhance",
  "menu_order": 91,
  "action_icon": "ai-action-restyle.svg",
  "output_type": "video",
  "template_id": "video-scene-cast-generate-source-profile",
  "open_dialog": true,
  "extra_inputs": [
    {
      "key": "source_profile_id",
      "type": "text",
      "group": "scene_cast",
      "group_label": "Scene Cast (Source Profile)",
      "label": "Source Profile",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "clip_id",
      "type": "text",
      "group": "scene_cast",
      "label": "Clip Segment",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "cast_entries_json",
      "type": "text",
      "group": "scene_cast",
      "label": "Cast Entries",
      "default": "[]"
    },
    {
      "key": "background_override_id",
      "type": "text",
      "group": "scene_cast",
      "label": "Background Override",
      "default": ""
    }
  ],
